# Build output
/aimem
/aimem.exe
dist/
bin/

# Local databases (journals, memories) if a state root lands in the tree
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Local secrets: never commit these
.creds/
providers.json

# aimem's OWN handoff. The installer creates docs/SESSION-STATE.md in every
# project it wires, and in YOUR project you should commit it - that is how
# the handoff reaches your other machines and your teammates. This repo is
# public, and its handoff carries hostnames and in-flight operational
# state, so here it stays local.
docs/SESSION-STATE.md

# This repo only: .aimem.json carries the operator's own hub binding and
# group membership, which are meaningless (or half-broken) on anyone
# else's machine. In YOUR projects, committing .aimem.json is right -
# a pinned project id shared across machines is the point of the file.
.aimem.json
